{"speciesId":850,"names":{"fr":"Grillepattes","es":"Sizzlipede","en":"Sizzlipede","ja":"ヤクデ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il produit de la chaleur grâce au gaz inflammable qu’il emmagasine dans son corps. La partie jaune de son abdomen est particulièrement brûlante."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Genera calor consumiendo el gas inflamable que almacena en su cuerpo. Los círculos amarillos del abdomen están particularmente calientes."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It stores flammable gas in its body and uses it to generate heat. The yellow sections on its belly get particularly hot."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"体に 溜めた 可燃ガスで 発熱。 とくに お腹の 黄色い 部分が 熱いのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il enserre fermement ses proies avec son corps brûlant et, quand elles sont bien grillées, il les dévore."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Oprime a sus presas con su cuerpo candente. Una vez bien tostadas, las devora con fruición."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It wraps prey up with its heated body, cooking them in its coils. Once they’re well-done, it will voraciously nibble them down to the last morsel."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"発熱した 体で 獲物を 締め上げる。 こんがり 焼けたら むしゃむしゃ いただくのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":850,"moves":[{"name":"slam","learns":[[20,"level-up",30]]},{"name":"wrap","learns":[[20,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[20,"level-up",10]]},{"name":"ember","learns":[[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"fire-spin","learns":[[20,"level-up",35],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"smokescreen","learns":[[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"defense-curl","learns":[[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"leech-life","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"flame-wheel","learns":[[20,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"snore","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"protect","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"endure","lea